      "summary": "L2-05 Action Publisher 验收脚本，通过 --case 子命令切换 local/command-disabled/permit-blocked/topic-payloads/ros-message-bundle/command-enabled-mock/ros-observe 七种场景，运行 G01-G17 标签并在 ROS/硬件缺失时记录预期 BLOCKED。",
